      "type": "LIKERT_SCALE",
      "description": "McNair, D. M., Lorr, M., & Droppleman, L. F. (1971). Manual for the Profile of Mood States. San Diego, CA: Educational and Industrial Testing Service. Yields a well-known derived Total Mood Disturbance (TMD) score (sum of Tension-Anxiety, Depression-Dejection, Anger-Hostility, Fatigue-Inertia and Confusion-Bewilderment, minus Vigor-Activity, plus a constant to avoid negative totals) -- not modelled as its own catalog construct here since it is computed from the other six indicators rather than from raw items.",
      "instructions": "Below is a list of words that describe feelings people have. Please read each word carefully, then indicate how much that feeling describes how you have been feeling during the past week, including today, by choosing the response that applies, from 'Not at all' to 'Extremely'. Researchers commonly adapt the time frame (e.g. 'right now', 'today', or 'during the past week including today') depending on whether a state or trait-like mood assessment is intended.",
      "phenomenon_name": "Mood State",
      "phenomenon_description": "The pattern of transient, situationally influenced affective/mood states, both positive and negative, that an individual experiences over a specified recent period (e.g. the past week, or the present moment).",
      "constructs": [
        {"name": "Tension-Anxiety (POMS)", "domain": "PSYCHOMETRIC_NEW", "definition": "Heightened musculoskeletal tension and subjective feelings of apprehension, nervousness and anxiety.", "weight_in_instrument": 1},
        {"name": "Depression-Dejection (POMS)", "domain": "PSYCHOMETRIC_NEW", "definition": "A mood of personal inadequacy, sadness, hopelessness and emotional depression, often accompanied by guilt.", "weight_in_instrument": 1},
        {"name": "Anger-Hostility (POMS)", "domain": "PSYCHOMETRIC_NEW", "definition": "A mood of anger, antipathy and hostility toward other people and the environment.", "weight_in_instrument": 1},
        {"name": "Vigor-Activity (POMS)", "domain": "PSYCHOMETRIC_NEW", "definition": "A mood of vigorousness, high energy and liveliness.", "weight_in_instrument": 1},
        {"name": "Fatigue-Inertia (POMS)", "domain": "PSYCHOMETRIC_NEW", "definition": "A mood of weariness, inertia and low energy.", "weight_in_instrument": 1},
        {"name": "Confusion-Bewilderment (POMS)", "domain": "PSYCHOMETRIC_NEW", "definition": "A mood of bewilderment and cognitive inefficiency, marked by muddled or uncertain thinking.", "weight_in_instrument": 1}
